Copy the fenced block below into the target repo root as `AGENTS.md`. The surrounding text is instructions for you, not content. Rewrite the Architecture section to match the repo's real structure. Keep the FORBIDDEN CHANGES section verbatim, only fixing the paths to where the files actually got installed.

